Standards conformance (informational)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package consumes JSON conforming to the ITI VPAT 2.5 INT template and
emits HTML aligned with W3C WCAG 2.2 AA, ETSI EN 301 549 v3.2.1, and US
Section 508 (36 CFR 1194). VPAT is a trademark of the Information Technology
Industry Council (ITI). No endorsement by ITI, W3C, ETSI, or US GSA is
implied.

